## Title: Evertally Guide Nav
## Notes: Part of Evertally Guide: walking routes for the arrow, by Evertally Guide's walking router, started from Shortest Path Forever's pathing (Cillian Berragan, github.com/cjber/shortest-path-forever, used with his permission). Loaded on demand.
